  m_Name: ShotIntoSky
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _name: ShotIntoSky
  _description: Terafine launches an arrow into the sky, which, when falling, creates
    an explosive wave that causes 12 to 18 physical damage to everyone who meets
    in its path. At the same time, the victim has a 30% chance of receiving 2.4 times
    more damage, as well as a 30% chance of being stunned for 2 seconds   "The people
    of the elves are famous for their accuracy, it is not for nothing that they say
    "The Elven arrow is a punishment from heaven""
  _icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e66d853c62ebcdd47a77a4812ea72e51, type: 3}
